  "prompt": "Billing wants to check the annual plans' invoices of 2025 against MRR. An annual subscription bills twelve months of its MRR at once, on its start day and on each anniversary of it (the same month and day in a later year; no annual subscription starts on 29 February); its other invoices bill the rest of a year after it grew, so leave them out. For each such invoice dated in 2025 (1 January to 31 December 2025), give the MRR it bills, worked out from its amount_local, in the subscription's currency. Return four columns, in this order: subscription_id, invoice_date, currency and mrr_local. Return one row for each such invoice. Any row order is fine.",
  "output_contract": {
    "columns": [
      {
        "name": "subscription_id",
        "type_class": "numeric"
      },
      {
        "name": "invoice_date",
        "type_class": "temporal"
      },
      {
        "name": "currency",
        "type_class": "text"
